{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18477","headline":"晨装行 · 欧阳詹","name":"晨装行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村店月西出，山林鹎鵊声。\n旅灯彻夜席，束囊事晨征。\n寂寂人尚眠，悠悠天未明。\n岂无偃息心，所务前有程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18477.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18477","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}